; error: 5:10: this may fail, and the last line of a loop that gives a value fails only with 'fail LoopResult.Manual(…)' written there; give it a plan B, as in 'x { 0 }'
; Another loop's failure on the last line says what that loop did.
task main()
    fixed q = each a in 0..2
        (each b in 0..a
            b
        fi)
    fi
    show(q { 0 })
fi
